# Local development and agent tooling
/.gitnexus/
/.claude/
# Contents rather than the directory itself: git never descends into an EXCLUDED
# directory, so a negation inside one can never re-include anything. The campaign
# records under sdd/ are tracked, and the previous `/.superpowers/` ignored every new
# one silently: they landed only when someone remembered `git add -f`, and the
# committed ones stayed visible purely because a tracked file outranks .gitignore.
# The agent tooling beside sdd/ stays ignored.
# NB: some setups also carry an untracked `.superpowers/sdd/.gitignore` holding `*`,
# written by local tooling. That wins over this rule in those working copies, so
# `git add -f` may still be needed there. It is not part of this repository.
/.superpowers/*
!/.superpowers/sdd/
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/.development/

# Local test and analysis output
/.pytest_cache/
/.mypy_cache/
/.ruff_cache/
/.coverage
/coverage.xml
/htmlcov/
/.venv/
